{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"HANDOFF (2026-11-16 session rebar-session-3d705fec).\n- aff9 sarcastic-specified-kodiakbear: plan-review certified, claimed (in_progress). Implemented on branch aff9-stale-clone-override, commit 0c4709684bf, Gerrit change 3405 (no known issues, not WIP), awaiting LLM-Review/Verified. Design: reclaimed baseline identified by a superseding store epoch whose new epoch_lineage names the local epoch; sync._do_reconverge backs HEAD up to refs/rebar/stale-override/<stamp>, resets to the remote, and replays unpushed events (uuid unknown to remote files/.retired/SNAPSHOT source_event_uuids) only if the oldest is inside [reclaim].horizon_days. Next: when both votes are +1, submit with scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py 3405 --revision 0c4709684bff5d178a6e044d6327baa8584fdaa5, then close aff9 from a worktree fast-forwarded to origin/main.\n- S2 emblematic-mutinous-loris: NOT yet reviewed/claimed (blocked on aff9 close). A drafted plan and code were proven in a throwaway probe (10/10 tests pass against bare remotes + FakeS3Remote): new src/rebar/_commands/reclaim_publish.py (stamp_superseding_epoch, publish_git_ref = one `push --atomic --force-with-lease` that also creates refs/tickets-backup/pre-reclaim-<stamp>, rollback_git_ref, publish_s3_bundle_set under the per-ref lock with PROTECTED#rollback-<stamp>/ copies and no doctor), plus compat.store_epoch_problem accepting a remote whose lineage names the local epoch (needed for rollback clients that share history). Drafts are in the session scratch dir and are not durable; re-derive from this description if lost.\n- 51a7 and 8dc4: untouched (dependency order).\n- No live tickets store or origin/tickets was rewritten, reset, swapped, or force-pushed.\n- Discovered bug shifty-genocidal-bat: gate_status stayed \"running\" ~60 min after the plan review signed; use plan_review_status as the source of truth meanwhile."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1794869551659322072,"uuid":"96bf129c-d415-402b-b861-8191e54be64f"}